# Pairs with EpochMeetsCoreClaim (E -> C). ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends no longer covers
# L's activations, so a claim returns a head below an append already allocated.
MODULE: EpochMeetsCoreClaimHeadUncovered
TARGET: EpochMeetsCoreClaim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: E's claim head no longer covers L's prior appends

--- FIND
ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends ==
    \A a \in Claimants : cstage[a] = 3 => \A o \in prior[a] : o < claimHead[a]
--- REPLACE
ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends ==
    \A a \in Claimants \ Acts : cstage[a] = 3 => \A o \in prior[a] : o < claimHead[a]
--- END
